int {csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-80463" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123320" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If ${F}^{′}(t)=⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,$ then $F(t)=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123320" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨{csc}^{2}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int {csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t,\\int (\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+{c}_{1},\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123320" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af59