valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨1,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+2t⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int 1\\,\\text{d}t,\\,\\int (\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+2t)\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨t+{c}_{1},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{t}^{2}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{t}^{2}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{t}^{2}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-99263" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92"} {"question" "q-99263" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-99263" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨1+t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+2{t}^{2}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨t,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨t,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{t}^{2}⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C"] ["math" "⟨{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t+{t}^{2}⟩+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-99263" "field" 