tegrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨4{t}^{2}-3t,\\,5{e}^{2t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{0}^{2}(4{t}^{2}-3t)\\,\\text{d}t,\\,{\\int }_{0}^{2}5{e}^{2t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor the first component,\n\n$$\n\\int (4{t}^{2}-3t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\frac{4}{3}{t}^{3}-\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFor the second component,\n\n$$\n\\int 5{e}^{2t}\\,\\text{d}t=5\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{e}^{2t}=\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{2t}.\n$$\n\nThus,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{2}⟨4{t}^{2}-3t,\\,5{e}^{2t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨(\\frac{4}{3}{t}^{3}-\\frac{3}{2}{t}^{2}){|}_{0}^{2},\\,(\\frac{5}{2}{e}^{2t}){|}_{0}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{4}{3}(8)-\\frac{3}{2}(4))-0,\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(\\frac{32}{3}-6),\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{14}{3},\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{14}{3},\\,\\frac{5}{2}({e}^{4}-1)⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-349120" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92"} {"question" "q-349120" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-349120" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{14}{3}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-349120" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-349120" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{5}{2}(e^4-1)"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123455" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "${\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123455" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}⟨\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t},\\,2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}\\frac{{csc}^{2}⁡t}{1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t}\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t){|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4},\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t{|}_{\\pi /2}^{3\\pi /4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}))-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})),\\,2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123455" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92"} {"question" "q-123455" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123455" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,2-\\sqrt{2}⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{2},\\,-\\sqrt{2}⟩"] ["math" "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\sqrt{2},\\,2⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-123455" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨\\operatorname{ln}⁡2,\\,\\sqrt{2}-2⟩"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-50200" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Evaluate ${\\int }_{1}^{4}⟨4t-1,\\sqrt{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-50200" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each componentt separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{4}⟨4t-1,\\,\\sqrt{t}⟩\\,\\text{d}t & =⟨{\\int }_{1}^{4}(4t-1)\\,\\text{d}t,{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\sqrt{t}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(2{t}^{2}-t){|}_{1}^{4},\\,(\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{{t}^{3}}){|}_{1}^{4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨(2(4)^{2}-4)-(2(1)^{2}-1),\\,\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{{4}^{3}}-\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{{1}^{3}}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨27,\\,\\frac{14}{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-50200" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "04eca659e09dc9a77301cd7af598024ca582eee954e6337d97e460da43fbcc92"} {"question" "q-50200" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14055375/state.json" "file_sha256" "c3966a8fb4d6c3ed445f7fd047396bd6ce60b6042d11d31c1d3ab32a30163a24"} {"question" "q-50200